// Packages this repository must not resolve. Checked by `diffra-guardrails deps check` in CI.
// Format and rules: docs/dependencies.md.

// Licences
nuget FluentAssertions >= 8.0 // Xceed commercial licence from 8.0; use AwesomeAssertions or FluentAssertions 7.x
nuget Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.CodeCoverage // proprietary Microsoft licence; the TUnit and MSTest meta-packages and MSTest.Sdk's Default profile bring it in, so reference the framework packages directly
nuget Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.Retry // proprietary Microsoft Testing Platform extension licence
// Pending a decision (#19): Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk depends on Microsoft.CodeCoverage, so this ban
// flags every VSTest project, this repository's tests included. CI reports it but does not fail.
nuget Microsoft.CodeCoverage // proprietary Microsoft licence; brought in by Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk

// Known-bad releases
nuget Moq >= 4.20.0 < 4.20.2 // SponsorLink in 4.20.0 and 4.20.1; use 4.20.2 or later
